                <mxCell id="c-crm" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CRM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Container: Битрикс24]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Клиенты, сделки, протезы&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#23A2D9;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="700" y="80" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-crmdb" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CRM DB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Database: Битрикс24]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Хранилище CRM&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;size=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#23A2D9;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.5,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="980" y="80" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-router" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Country Router /&lt;br&gt;Federation Gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Container: routing by country / domain]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Определяет IdP страны представительства (RU, EU, ...). Идентификационные данные остаются в юрисдикции страны&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#B46504;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#8A4B02;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="660" y="300" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-bff" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;BFF (Auth Proxy)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Container: Node.js / Spring Boot]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Терминирует OIDC (Authorization Code + PKCE S256) на сервере. Токены IdP не покидают сервер: клиенту — только непрозрачная HttpOnly cookie. Выпускает внутренний JWT с единым user_id, проксирует запросы к API&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#B46504;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#8A4B02;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="660" y="520" width="280" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-session" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Session Store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Database: Redis]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Серверные сессии: access/refresh-токены IdP, code_verifier, метаданные. Короткий TTL, ротация refresh-токенов&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;size=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#B46504;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;strokeColor=#8A4B02;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.5,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1020" y="490" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-mapping" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Identity Mapping&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Database: PostgreSQL, per-country replica]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Сопоставление (страна, IdP, subject) → единый user_id BionicPRO. Хранится в юрисдикции страны представительства&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;size=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#B46504;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;strokeColor=#8A4B02;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.5,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1020" y="680" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-app" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Мобильное приложение&lt;br&gt;для донастройки протеза&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Container: iOS, Android]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Донастройка и управление протезом. Работает только с cookie-сессией BFF, токены IdP в устройство не попадают&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#23A2D9;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="420" y="490" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-web" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Web-приложение отчётов&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Container: React, nginx]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Отчёты и управление в браузере. Вход через BFF — токены IdP в браузер не попадают&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#23A2D9;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="420" y="680" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-chip" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Программа в чипе протеза&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Software System: Embedded]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Чтение датчиков, распознавание движений, телеметрия, выполнение команд донастройки&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#1061B0;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#0D5091;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="420" y="880" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-api" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Container: Python]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Телеметрия, отчёты, команды протезу. Валидирует внутренний JWT (один issuer от BFF); user_id — только из токена (row-level)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#23A2D9;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="700" y="880" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-pg" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;База данных&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Database: PostgreSQL]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Телеметрия датчиков. Хранится в юрисдикции страны представительства&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;size=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#23A2D9;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.5,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1040" y="880" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c-cli" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;cli tool&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Container: Python]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E6E6E6&quot;&gt;Инструмент аналитики для ML-инженера&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#23A2D9;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1">
